{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53007","headline":"赠钱起（题拟） · 杨员外","name":"赠钱起（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄卷读来今已老，白头受屈不曾言。\n（见《钱考功集》卷八《酬考功杨员外见赠佳句》自注引）（按：《郎官石柱题名》考功员外郎一栏残泐过甚，存名仅五十二人，无杨姓者。\n劳《考》卷十复自羣书采摭补遗，有杨於陵贞元八年後曾任此职，其时已较後。\n颇此人即与钱起有过往之杨绾，然两《唐书》本传皆不云其任考外事。\n姑存疑以俟考详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨员外","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}